<title>HONG KONG: Regal Hotels interim net rises 26.67 pct.</title>
<headline>Regal Hotels interim net rises 26.67 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 6.1     vs 4.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  2.0     vs 1.8</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	nil     vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			  202.8   vs 160.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		   1,496.7 vs 1,347.0</p>
<p>    Company name	     Regal Hotels International Holdings</p>
<p>				   Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		October 22-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 November 6</p>
<p>NOTE - Regal Hotels, an associate of Century City International Holdings Ltd, is a hotel owner and manager.</p>
<p>Calculation of earnings per ordinary share is based on earnings attributable to ordinary shareholders of HK$185 million after a provision of HK$17.8 million for the dividend on the 5.25 percent Convertible Cumulative Redeemable Preference Shares and on the weighted average of 3,004 million ordinary shares in issue during the period.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
